r bits for the ADD-produced page in ID as well.\\nThis removes the full-width addition from both uses of those operands.\\n\\nDeliver the registered provisional word directly to an adjacent EX\\nconsumer. In MEM, correct the upper 16 bits by true_carry minus\\nguessed_carry, \n…[6264 of 9336 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:d07c231da0838330]…\nr.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 262.42, \"delta_pct\": -0.51, \"vs_baseline\": 2065.18, \"fmax_mhz\": 84.95, \"ipc_coremark\": 3e-06, \"cycles\": 3237153, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4934, \"ff\": 907, \"seeds\": [78.013, 84.95, 84.95], \"perturbations\": [[0, 78.013, 11], [1, 84.95, 10], [2, 84.95, 10]], \"lutram\": 96, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 5, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_if/successors_successors_0_0_s\", \"to\": \"dmem_1_dmem_1_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -7.818, \"arrival_ns\": 18.113, \"logic_cells\": 17, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 11, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-20T18:29:05.257691Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 15, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-11-20 hyp-20261120-002-r15s1 (regression, -0.51%): Correcting the upper sum in MEM triggered only 2,002 dependent replays over ten CoreMark iterations, but the path from EX/MEM result bit 0 through the low adder and ID address bit 12 to data RAM limited median Fmax to 84.950 MHz.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
