e UART validation banner matched. The self-test and\\nthree randomized programs matched the reference with and without stalls.\\nThe directed pipeline tests and all 53 single-channel formal checks passed.\\nGowin placement options 0, 1 and 2 reached 62.465, 64.034 and 64.034 MHz.\\nThe median gives\n…[9855 of 12927 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:ef4875298fcccb19]…\n \"delta_pct\": 11.61, \"vs_baseline\": 1162.62, \"fmax_mhz\": 62.004, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4051673, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3580, \"ff\": 865, \"seeds\": [60.129, 62.004, 62.004], \"perturbations\": [[0, 60.129, 15], [1, 62.004, 15], [2, 62.004, 15]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s\", \"to\": \"dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -11.631, \"arrival_ns\": 21.926, \"logic_cells\": 15, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 15, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-20T04:31:44.919148Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 4, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-11-20 hyp-20261120-002-r4s1 (regression, +11.61%): A one-entry IF buffer let decode issue a word saved during an interlock even with `io_imemReady` low, saving 119,419 cycles over unbuffered EX target fetch across ten CoreMark iterations, but lower Fmax reduced throughput from 153.52 to 153.03 iterations/s.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
