{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c 'cat formal/checks_si.cfg && ls -a /opt/gowin/IDE/bin && ls -la bench/programs'","aggregated_output":"[options]\nisa rv32im\nnret 1\nsolver bitwuzla\n\n[depth]\n# BMC depth per check. 2nd column (where present) is the k-induction prove\n# depth. Keep depths matched to the current pipeline so bugs within ~20\n# cycles of any symbolic instruction stream are exposed.\ninsn          20\nreg       10  20\npc_fwd    10  20\npc_bwd    10  20\ncausal    10  20\n# unique   — no two retirements share rvfi_order (catches double-retire)\n# cover    — sanity that the CPU retires (prevents vacuous-pass suites)\n# ill      — illegal instructions must trap; rvfi_trap from decoder.is_illegal\n# liveness — CPU makes forward progress under any symbolic stream\nunique     1 10 20\ncover      1    20\nill             20\nliveness   1 10 20\n\n[defines]\n`define RISCV_FORMAL_ALIGNED_MEM\n# RISCV_FORMAL_ALTOPS — fast mode. Same as checks.cfg. See checks.cfg for\n# the full rationale on what ALTOPS does and does not prove. M-extension\n# arithmetic correctness is covered by test/test_alu.py and `make formal-deep`.\n`define RISCV_FORMAL_ALTOPS\n\n[cover]\n# Sanity cover: the CPU must retire at least one non-trapping instruction.\nalways @* if (!reset) cover (rvfi_valid && !rvfi_trap);\n\n[verilog-files]\n# run_all.sh rebuilds this section from the actual rtl/ glob; the list\n# below is overwritten before genchecks runs. Kept as a placeholder so\n# the section is syntactically present for any reader inspecting the cfg.\n@basedir@/cores/@core@/core.sv\n@basedir@/cores/@core@/wrapper.sv\n.\n..\nGowinModGen\nGowinSynthesis\nQtWebEngineProcess\nassistant\neye_mon_task_gen.dist\nfloorplanner\ngao_analyzer\ngao_sh\ngvio_analyzer\ngvio_sh\ngw_ctrl_reg\ngw_fsrst_gui\ngw_goeye\ngw_ide\ngw_pkgviewer\ngw_sdceditor\ngw_sh\nhardcore.xml\nhierarchy\nnlsresource\nprim_syn.v\nprim_syn.vhd\nprim_syns\nprimitive.xml\nprogrammer.json\nqt.conf\nresources\nrtlHierTest\nserdes_toml_to_csr.dist\nssc_task_gen.dist\ntranslations\nvhdl_packages\nvlg_pp\ntotal 464\ndrwxrwx---+  3 nobody nogroup   4096 Nov 20 18:09 .\ndrwxrwx---+  3 nobody nogroup   4096 Nov 20 18:09 ..\n-rw-rw----+  1 nobody nogroup   2317 Nov 20 18:09 Makefile\ndrwxrwx---+ 14 nobody nogroup   4096 Nov 20 18:09 coremark\n-rw-rw----+  1 nobody nogroup    135 Nov 20 18:09 crt0.S\n-rw-rw----+  1 nobody nogroup   6341 Nov 20 18:09 gen_random_trace.py\n-rw-rw----+  1 nobody nogroup    330 Nov 20 18:09 link.ld\n-rw-rw----+  1 nobody nogroup 140494 Nov 20 18:09 random1.S\n-rw-rw----+  1 nobody nogroup 138125 Nov 20 18:09 random2.S\n-rw-rw----+  1 nobody nogroup 142438 Nov 20 18:09 random3.S\n-rw-rw----+  1 nobody nogroup   3684 Nov 20 18:09 selftest.S\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
