{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"The champion’s reported worst path crosses two 35-bit divider digit selections in one clock. I’ve written a schema-valid proposal that uses two narrow selections for small divisors and one wide selection for large divisors. I’ll time a scratch prototype to see whether that change reaches the 68.48 MHz acceptance threshold."}}
