    description: |\n      Connect both instruction-source tags and displacements to the RF\n      and address-generation logic. Wire the ALU grants, decoded modes\n      and executing producer eligibility across the existing boundary.\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: |\n      Alternate live and replayed loads with different base tags and\n      displacements, including a WB collision on just one port and a\n      rejected replay carrying a store. Check accepted addresses and\n      data across repeated denials, retirement order and raw operands.\nYAML\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json,yaml,jsonschema\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261120-002-r10s1.yaml')\nd=yaml.safe_load(p.read_text());jsonschema.validate(d,json.load(open('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json')))\nassert d['id']==p.stem and d['category']=='structural'\nprint('Validated',p.name)\nPY\ndate -u\"", "aggregated_output": "Validated hyp-20261120-002-r10s1.yaml\nFri Nov 20 10:23:08 UTC 2026\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
