lt\\ntogether exactly once, enabling ordinary EX/MEM forwarding to its consumer.\\n\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Hold the fetch PC and ID/EX while the resident divide awaits completion.\\nAllow older instructions to drain. Give an outstanding dmem wait priority\\nfor holding EX/MEM and retaining MEM/WB forwarding data. Release the divid", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
