accepted store while both buses stall and a wrong-path store or divider occupies EX.\\\"\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\nassert yaml.safe_load(s)['id']==p.stem\np.write_text(s)\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
