- file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: |\n      Warm a short loop, deny fetch on its second trip and check the\n      fall-through instruction retires once. Deny a taken target and\n      check the target retries. Exercise an offset-127 region crossing,\n      two regions with equal low PC bits, and a replayed load dependent\n      on a stalled producer. After FENCE.I, change a previously fetched\n      word and require the new instruction. Check bus strobes and RVFI PCs,\n      data and order with a store encoding on denied fetches.\nPROPOSAL\"", "aggregated_output": "", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
