a, tag, set, offset and validity together. Clear eligibility on address repair or squash.\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: Check the candidate against the resident load and feed the selected raw word to both the existing subword formatter and RVFI.\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: Release a denied load on a verified local hit. Preserve holds for address repair and outstanding external accesses.\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: Exercise changing sectors at one load PC, same-set tag aliases, byte stores between prediction and use, and held or annulled consumers. Check bus acceptances, forwarded values and RVFI order.\nEOF\npython - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json,jsonschema,yaml\np=Path('cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261120-003-r14s2.yaml');v=yaml.safe_load(p.read_text());jsonschema.validate(v,json.load(open('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json')));assert v['id']==p.stem;print(v['title'],263.77*1.046*.316)\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "Predict a load's 64-byte sector two instructions ahead 87.18548072\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
