'logic_cells': 75, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_ex/u_alu']}\nlesson - 2026-11-20 hyp-20261120-003-r6s2 (improvement, +14.62%): Issuing loads in EX let dependent branches use EX/MEM forwarding with either address generator, and the full-width adder took only 22 more cycles over ten CoreMark iterations while reaching 64.020 MHz versus 61.400 MHz for same-page prediction in matched prototypes.\nimplementation_notes \n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
